### Let me also think about idempotency

If the cleanup runs twice:
- DELETE on addresses: no-op second time
- DELETE on contacts: no-op
- UPDATE customers.customers: would re-anonymize, but values are deterministic from customer_id, so OK
- UPDATE email_deliveries: WHERE status IN ('pending','processing') - safe on second run
- All updates/deletes should be idempotent

For MinIO/Redis/OpenSearch: deleting twice is fine.

